==Battleground==
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.
*5 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPIs]] spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring strong [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] and [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] to deal with [[The Face]] and [[Shy Boy]]s, as they will be a barrier for how long you stay in the stage.  [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] will appear occasionally until up to 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, when 5 will start to appear.  If you're able to survive the onslaught of [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]], then only [[Shy Boy]] will appear.

